Tool response:
Tool: get_portfolio_metrics
Description: Fetches the latest 30-day annualized volatility and Sharpe ratio for the 'Schwab Intelligent Portfolios Premium' account associated with the authenticated user.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "account_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "The account ID of the 'Schwab Intelligent Portfolios Premium' account",
          "title": "Account Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "account_id"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: find_accounts
Description: Filter accounts by the specified account type and return matching account IDs and numbers for the authenticated user.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "account_type": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Account type to filter by",
          "title": "Account Type"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "account_type"
      ]
    }
